WK", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18173, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01YRh5AJt1hn2M4FWkevpCJz", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Last production release that was healthy was v2.3.0. Actions taken: (1) Rolled back to v2.3.0. The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error after us-east had moved to v2.3.0, leaving the service mixed (us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). (2) Retried the rollback to v2.3.0, which completed in all regions: us-east, us-west, eu-west. Current state: v2.3.0 in all three regions, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-ups: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial-failure cause; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until fixed and validated. v2.3.1-rc was unhealthy in staging and was not deployed to production."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 48773, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01YRh5AJt1hn2M4FWkevpCJz", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 48773, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YRh5AJt1hn2M4FWkevpCJz", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49725, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_017c9rL8yAcG9ksjATnVtFxJ", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 50025, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017c9rL8yAcG9ksjATnVtFxJ", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50025, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017c9rL8yAcG9ksjATnVtFxJ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 52176, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it is healthy again (error rate 0.002, down from 0.18).\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy release. The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error after us-east had moved to v2.3.0, which left the service mixed. I retried the rollback once and it completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the SEV2 incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found it had been created, so I did not open a duplicate. It is INC-0001, open, and its summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry.\n\nFollow-ups for the team:\n- Find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks.\n- Find out what caused the orchestrator partial failure.\n- Don't redeploy v2.3.1 until it is fixed and validated.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01JyPHRHi5TUFEzEu4BY4ZaV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01RE5HGPmU3VfRSwSCqQNyWj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. 